d were not the killer. And whom the killer is, is no secret.  There is no question about it, people are covering something up that is very criminal. Being this matter is taking place in Eastern Idaho, there is a bond in that part of Idaho that defies all truth and honesty when that bond needs it to. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7125002699319778734/comments/default/7481498669958114126'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7125002699319778734/comments/default/7481498669958114126'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/justice-has-no-expiration-date.html?showComment=1480382834303#c7481498669958114126' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/11/justice-has-no-expiration-date.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7125002699319778734' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7125002699319778734' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1880356405"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 28, 2016 at 6:27 PM"/></entry></feed>